AV1 syntax parsing

The local syntax module in crates/codec/kernels/av1/src/bitstream adapts the AV1 parser from
cros-codecs 0.0.6 (commit 7a4211c57ac2e791412f40df2c22fd2cf81104f6).
Container probing, owned OBU copies, unused operating-point selection and
Linux/VAAPI/V4L2 backends are not part of this implementation. Its bit reader
uses local bounded primitives, with local tile-boundary and syntax fixes.
There is no cros-codecs runtime dependency.
Copyright The ChromiumOS Authors. BSD-3-Clause;
see crates/codec/kernels/av1/licenses/COPYING.ChromiumOS.
Source: https://github.com/chromeos/cros-codecs
The D3D11 AV1 parameter mapping references FFmpeg's dxva2_av1.c and remains
covered by the existing LGPL-2.1-or-later notice and COPYING.FFmpeg.

